# ============================================================
docs/codeindex/all_ast_trees_dev.md
docs/codeindex/all_graph_dev.json
docs/codeindex/all_source_code_dev.md
docs/codeindex/all_source_defs_docstrings_dev.md
docs/codeindex/all_user_defined_functions_dev.md
docs/codeindex/column_layout_graph.html
docs/codeindex/create_codeindex_log.txt
docs/_build/


# ============================================================
# Catch-all: any folder named *gitignore* is local scratch
# (legacy convention from before this policy)
# ============================================================
**/*gitignore*/
**/*gitignore*/**


